      "questionName": "chopsticks, bowl, celebration, recipe",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the following words.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_2_-_customs_and_traditions_ea43a2e8.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Nga: Hi Liam! Did you enjoy the family dinner last night?</p>\n<p>Liam: Yes, it was great! This is the first time I've used <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><input id='fbo-899780-0' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-899780-0' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899780-0' /></span></strong>. It was fun!</p>\n<p>Nga: That&#8217;s good to hear. It&#8217;s part of the tradition. Did you like the soup in the red <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><input id='fbo-899780-1' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-899780-1' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899780-1' /></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Liam: Yes, it was delicious! Do you know the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><input id='fbo-899780-2' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-899780-2' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899780-2' /></span></strong> for it?</p>\n<p>Nga: I think it&#8217;s a family secret, but I will try asking my mom for it.</p>\n<p>Liam: That would be nice! By the way, what was the reason for the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><input id='fbo-899780-3' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-899780-3' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899780-3' /></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Nga: It was to welcome the Lunar New Year. It&#8217;s an important tradition for us.</p>\n<p>Liam: That&#8217;s wonderful. Thanks for inviting me to the meal!</p>",
