      "questionText": "<p><strong>Reorder the letters to make complete words. The first letters are underlined.</strong></p>\n<p>Lan: Hi, Minh! Did you visit any special places during the weekend?</p>\n<p>Minh: Yes, I went to Ngoc Son<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-899759-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-899759-0' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899759-0' /></span></strong> <strong>(E-P-E-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">T</span>-M-L)</strong> with my family.</p>\n<p>Lan: That&#8217;s nice! Did you bring any <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-899759-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-899759-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899759-1' /></span> (G-E-R-I-F-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">O</span>-N-F)</strong>?</p>\n<p>Minh: We brought fruits and flowers as a sign of respect. Have you been there before?</p>\n<p>Lan: Yes, I went last year. After the visit, we had <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-899759-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-899759-2' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899759-2' /></span> (N-P-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">S</span>-I-G-R)</strong> rolls for lunch.</p>\n<p>Minh: I love them! My family enjoyed some ice-creams made with young <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-899759-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-899759-3' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899759-3' /></span> (I-E-C-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R</span>)</strong>.</p>\n<p>Lan: That sounds delicious! I like that time because I can spend time hanging out with my family.</p>\n<p>Minh: I agree. It&#8217;s also a great way to celebrate our customs.</p>",
